        <h3>ABTracker Out Of Beta</h3>
        November 18, 2026
    </div>
    <div class="content">
        <p>
            We've finally removed the <b>beta</b> status from the website, now that it's become more stable and complete.
            We're committed to running the site long-term!
        </p>
        <p>
            Thanks to some recent enhancements, it's now a lot easier for us to keep the work we do for BCTracker synced up with ABTracker.
